<title>JAPAN: Japan Securities to halt lending Daiei shares.</title>
<headline>Japan Securities to halt lending Daiei shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Securities Finance Co Ltd said on Friday that it would halt fresh lending of Daiei Inc shares on July 28.</p>
<p>Japan Securities, which lends shares to brokerages whose clients wish to sell short in margin transactions, said in a statement that the step reflected outstanding positions of the shares in the loan market and in margin transactions, and had nothing to do with Daiei's business performance.</p>
</text>
